[[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the ramp.</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Undo the nuts (1a) (1b)  and remove the turbocharger bracket\n(1c).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021858.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the turbocharger mounting bracket\nback in its housing and secure it using the bolts.</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Position the vehicle on the ramp.</p>"]]